\subsection{Concepts related to Evolutionary Aging}

The concepts of Software Entropy, Software Decay (including Architectural Decay, Design Decay, and Aging Decay), TD (primarily comprising Architectural Debt, Design Debt, etc.,) and our proposed AD are intricately related. Figure \ref{aging_position} shows the intricate relationship between them and highlights the factors contributing to software aging, indicating our contribution in this work. 


