The unique focus of AD on the evolutionary aging of source code provides a vital strategic dimension  beyond the traditional scope of TD. It offers a broad view of how software evolves over time, aligning with technological advancements, evolving dependencies, and changing requirements. %and shifts in the business context. Consequently, AD enables informed decisions that consider the broader implications of software evolution rather than merely addressing the immediate symptoms of poor design or rushed development typically reflected in TD.
