\subsection{Results}
This section contains the results of the three steps involved in detecting SAAD comments, as discussed in Section \ref{sec:det_saad_approach}, using text patterns. It includes, A. Software Aging features, B. Code Context evaluated SAAD patterns and C. Code Context evaluated SAAD comments.
\paragraph{A. Software Aging Features}
