\subsubsection{Dormant Aging} This refers to parts of the software that are either already obsolete or becoming inactive and eventually obsolete. Although such sections may not cause immediate issues, they represent a deferred maintenance burden in the form of refactoring or removal. We refer to the pending maintenance effort associated with these items as Dormant SAAD. 
