\textbullet	If $x\in S_1$, we have two cases: either $g(x)\leq g(x_1)-\frac{1}{n}$ and, therefore, $x\notin [x_1,x_2)$ and $h(x)=0$; or $g(x)\geq  g(x_2)$, in which case, we have two cases:

