sequence
\[
1\rightarrow W'(\Gamma)\hookrightarrow W(\Gamma)\rightarrow S_3\rightarrow 1,
\]
in Proposition~\ref{pr:E_3Cartan} splits. 

Moreover, consider the flag
\[
\cF:\quad 1\leq S\leq K\leq G,
\]
where $S=\langle s,s',s''\rangle=\langle g\in G\mid \cL_g\ \text{is a Cartan subalgebra}\rangle$, and $K=\langle g\in G\mid \cL_g=0\rangle$. Then the Weyl group is the stabilizer of $\cF$:
\[
