\cF:\quad 1\leq S\leq G,
\]
where $S=\langle s,s',s''\rangle=\langle g\in G\mid \cL_g\ \text{is a Cartan subalgebra}\rangle$. Then
the Weyl group is the stabilizer of $\cF$:
\[
W(\Gamma)=\Stab_{\Aut(G)}(\cF).
\]
\end{theorem}

