%For \textbf{data ordering}, the dataset $\Dtrn$ is reorganized into a new dataset $\Dtrn' = \left[ \xtrn_{\pi(1)}, \xtrn_{\pi(2)}, \cdots, \xtrn_{\pi(|\Dtrn|)} \right]$ of the same size ($|\Dtrn'| = |\Dtrn|$), based on a permutation $\pi$ determined by $f'(\vga)$.
