    \caption{Scheme of payload assembly process, from step (a) to (g). (a) the first piece is called the baseframe and it already contains most of the internal plastic structures; (b) incorporation of batteries and electronics; (c) placement of battery enclosure; (d) closure of two sides; (e) placement of the menstrual cups inside the payload box; (f) closure of two other sides; (g) the side panels and top lid are closed using 4 M3 countersunk hex screws on the four corners.}
    \vspace{0.5em}
