\section{Methodology}
In order to predict the behaviour of the 5 transistor level converters in state of the art technology node, we employ the metal gate, high-K, and strained-Si High Performance 22 nm Predictive Technology Model (PTM) version: 4.0 level: 54 \cite{PTM}. All simulations are done using SPICE with 22 nm technology node \cite{LTspice}.
