\section{Conclusion}
In this paper, we employ SPICE-PIDE to optimize integrated circuits that operate with dual supply voltages.
%We have demonstrated the effectiveness of the SPICE-PIDE method in order to achieve enhanced energy efficiency and better performance of 5 transistor level shifters. 
We find that the SPICE-PIDE optimizer can provide the solution sets considering metrics like avg. power, PDP, etc. for any circuit without increasing the computational load significantly. Besides, the most efficient solutions, as shown in Table I $\&$ Table II, can be utilized for the purpose of designing ultra-low power systems with improved performance.

