along $\Tpc(\hmu_B)$ (\eq{eq:Tpc}) 
calculated in QCD compared to HIC results. The ${\rm ALICE}[N_{\rm tot}]$ and ${\rm STAR}[N_{\rm tot}]$ data have been obtained by taking into account the contribution of neutral hadrons to the 
total hadron multiplicity as done in \cite{Braun-Munzinger:2014lba}
(see \eq{eq:kinv-approx} and discussion in the text). In the inset we present $P \kappa_{T,X}$ obtained from QCD ($X=\sigma_Q^2$) and  HRG ($X=N_{\rm tot}$) calculations along the line $\Tpc(\hmu_B)$. 
}
\label{fig:isothermal_compressibility_muB}
