We shall name the two sub variations of this integral as,

\beqn
I_{1.1} &=&  \left[\frac{3}{32}\frac{D}{\mu_x^{1/2}\mu_\bot^{3/2}}\frac{S_{d-1}}{(2\pi)^{d-1}}\Lambda^{d-4}d\ell+\frac{3}{32}\frac{KD}{\mu_x^{1/2}\mu_\bot^{5/2}}\frac{S_{d-1}}{(2\pi)^{d-1}}\Lambda^{d-4}d\ell\right]\ ,
