\\
&=& k_x\frac{1}{32}\frac{\gamma D}{\kappa_1\mu_x^{1/2}\mu_\bot^{3/2}}\frac{S_{d-1}}{(2\pi)^{d-1}}\Lambda^{d-4}d\ell+{\rm h.o.t}\ .
